WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.273
Have you ever downloaded a game on a phone?

00:00:03.223 --> 00:00:06.210
They usually don't cost very much.

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:09.789
But the government needed an app called ArriveCAN.

00:00:09.789 --> 00:00:16.039
They ended up paying a tiny company of just two people over 50 million dollars to build it!

00:00:16.039 --> 00:00:21.710
That's like paying for a million video games, but you only got one small app.

00:00:21.710 --> 00:00:25.065
The police are now looking into where it all went.
